  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759176,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1000 Cooking Recipes from Elle à Table - Nintendo DS\n\nEmbark on a culinary journey with *1000 Cooking Recipes from Elle à Table* for the Nintendo DS, a delightful cooking guide inspired by the renowned French cuisine magazine. Dive into a vast collection of 1000 authentic recipes, ranging from simple appetizers to elaborate desserts, all presented in an accessible and engaging format. \n\nGuided by a helpful voice assistant, you'll learn essential cooking techniques and master the art of French cuisine. Beyond just recipes, the game provides valuable nutritional information to help you make informed choices.  \n\nCreate your own personalized menus, drawing inspiration from recommended pairings or crafting entirely new culinary creations.  Share your delicious discoveries with friends and family, showcasing your newfound skills and expanding your repertoire. Whether you're a seasoned chef or a novice cook, *1000 Cooking Recipes from Elle à Table* offers a fun and educational experience for everyone."
    },
